  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392160,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] Whoa, pretty good.\n-Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394120,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] 100 you're on now.\n-100. Okay and I'm gonna\ncall it a day there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397600,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've had a lovely day out.\nI'm gonna cash out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400960,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] R... right.\n-I've had a lovely day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402880,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] There's two more spins...\n-I've had a lovely day,\nthank you Alex."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405760,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] There's still...\nwhen the fun stops. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408120,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I've had a lovely time.\n-[Alex] We can say goodbye\nto the Gregs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-We can. Thank you.\n-[Alex, blows whistle]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413000,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm very happy with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415800,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think\nwe've ever had someone go\nthat's enough tasking for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419000,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Thank you.\n-But it did say achieve\nthe highest score,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422080,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have maximum of five spins.\nThere was nothing saying you had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424840,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do five spins.\n-Exactly. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426480,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You both did worse\nthan Isy Sutie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428280,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yes.\n-Who just gave\nsomebody four eggs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432040,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If someone gave me eggs,\nI'd love it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438920,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a fascinating...\nfascinating insight into\none of our competitors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446000,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But she's right, her\nidiosyncratic system did work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448880,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-She ended up with 200 points.\n-It, it worked by sheer chance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452840,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Maybe that's what it takes.\n-Maybe that's what life is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456120,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] In a way there was\na lot of red herrings.\nThe lying, the eggs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all that was relevant\nthere was getting as\nmany pineapples as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461920,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what you had to do.\nNone of you really grasped\nthat at any point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466440,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanna know\nwhat Chloe did though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469120,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think if anyone had the right\napproach... it might be Chloe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Oh, if anyone's gonna\nactually make an effort\nit's Chloe for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476320,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes it takes courage\nto walk away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479960,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, that can be\nthe bravest thing\nyou can do in life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483840,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're looking at\na goddamn hero here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487480,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we go,\nit's Lucas and Petts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491080,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I'm just gonna do that.\n-[Alex] It's spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494320,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Egg, pineapple, egg.\n-Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497520,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] Two eggs\nand a pineapple has added\nzero points altogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1500440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Right.\n-[Alex] Is there anything\nyou'd like to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502560,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think egg loss would be good.\nIt'd be good to lose an egg.\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506000,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] That's 500 points.\n-I'm doing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508120,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I'm gonna ask them a question.\n-[Alex] Which one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510040,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most trustworthy one.\nIt's the one with the ponytails\npoking out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513400,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the woman.\nEr, is this randomised? Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518120,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Er, number one,\nare you going to produce an egg\nagain next time? Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524080,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] We're spinning.\nScore of 200."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did I ask him would\nhe produce an egg next time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528520,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you're the liar.\nGreg one is a liar.\nHere's a question,"
