  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538080,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "away from number three.\n-[Alex] Yes, you did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539920,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-So that's fortunate.\n-Oh, that Greg\ncould've been lying to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543200,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Greg number two,\nis this randomised?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547800,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is rhyme or reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549360,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] And we're spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552680,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another 200. And we're spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555680,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Oh, that's good.\n-I'm gonna randomise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558920,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] Third spin,\nokay here we go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561920,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] So, it's 200 again.\n-Is this the last spin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564320,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] Yeah.\n-Okay.\nI'm just gonna play again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568600,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you lied.\nYou didn't like eggs.\nWhat the fuck is this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574240,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Erm, if all three of them, ah,\ncan, can I get all three of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578720,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to produce pineapples\nand that'll cost me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582040,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "900 but then I'll be\na hundred up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584120,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] So, this is gonna\ncost you 900 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1586040,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just gonna ask the\nthird Greg, is producing\nthree pineapples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589640,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my best bet at this point?\n-[Alex] He's nodding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592680,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think he knows\nhis arse from his elbow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594800,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Three pineapples please.\n-[Alex] All three pineapples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599920,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] One minute, one spin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number three. Shall I do\nthe pineapple plan again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1606160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex][laughs]\n-Right I hate you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608160,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I, er, that's pissed me\noff that has.\n-[Alex] 30 seconds Chloe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611560,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Right. Three pineapples please.\n-[Alex] We're spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614080,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sorry. I don't like that\nas much as you guys\ndon't like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617720,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] There we go.\n[blows whistle]\nWell, a very tactical game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620360,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I wish you all the best.\n-Is there anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622480,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "left for me to do?\nOr is the task over?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624280,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Alex] Got a question\nyou wanna ask them and then..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626200,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, we're in the middle\nof like this steam museum\nor something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629640,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has nothing\nto do with steam,\nyou've missed out on like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632760,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what could've been an amazing\neducational opportunity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636480,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Alex] Thanks Matt.\n-Alright my pleasure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645360,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I'm not sure\nwhat happened there.\n-I'm no good at that. And..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649000,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well you're very good\nat telling people off\nthat's for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651520,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yes.\n-You were a sort of weird PE\nteacher by the end of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655520,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it just got\nto the point where like\nRichard I was pleased"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659920,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with what I had, but we have\nvery different personalities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of, erm, burning\neverything to the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1667200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I decided to strategise\nand gain myself more points.\n-[Greg] Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672000,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-I'd just like\nto come back on that.\n-Please. Please."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675840,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I felt was\nthat I left the game\nand it is a game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679840,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "erm, with good will intact,\nI came away with one hun..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684320,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean let's not forget\nI came away with 100 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688600,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't know how many\npoints were on offer.\nFor me that's like the,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691360,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the, like someone just gave me\nthe sky Greg. I mean 100 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697000,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine it,\nI'd come in that day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698520,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't have a point\nto my name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700520,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Chloe, do you wanna\ncome back on that?\n-I got 600 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705280,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could've had\n2,000 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707200,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the, the best method,\nyou were just trying\nto get pineapples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709920,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just remove all the eggs\nand ducks that would cost you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712760,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a total of 3,000 points.\nBut every time from then on\nyou'll get a thousand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a thousand, a thousand,\na thousand, a thousand,\nyou'll get 2,000 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720320,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it was just kind\nof looking through\nall those stupid rules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723440,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even as you say it now\nI still don't care."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725520,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. I, I get that. I get that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728640,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Points wise it means\nthat Nina gets one\nfor getting minus 300."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733200,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yes.\n-[Alex] Richard two for 100,\nIsy three for 200,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736000,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Matt 4 for 400 but the winner\nof the task was Chloe Petts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738760,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with 600 points,\nwhich is five points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746280,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-[Greg] One more please.\n-Sure thing and this one\nspans many months"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750920,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and potentially several\ncontinents."
    } ]
